WEBVTT

00:08.842 --> 00:16.883
As a white, crescent moon overlooks the town

00:16.883 --> 00:24.881
From within a pale, blue maze
devilish things begin to stir

00:32.399 --> 00:36.202
Boy, here in this sinful world

00:36.202 --> 00:39.205
Believing, dreaming

00:39.205 --> 00:43.043
We are searching

00:43.043 --> 00:48.174
For the place to which souls should aspire

00:49.983 --> 00:58.391
Ah, how much profound darkness
must we turn to light

00:58.391 --> 01:02.962
For the color of the world to change?

01:02.962 --> 01:05.632
Ah, surely someday

01:05.632 --> 01:13.907
Ah, how many profound riddles must we solve

01:13.907 --> 01:18.867
For the door to paradise to open?

01:20.413 --> 01:27.046
Let's begin our journey

01:50.376 --> 01:51.468
Hel!

01:56.883 --> 01:57.975
Hel...

01:59.085 --> 02:04.853
The 25th Night
The Dream's Final Stop

02:05.391 --> 02:07.018
Master Loki...

02:10.029 --> 02:12.732
This must be difficult for Master Loki.

02:12.732 --> 02:15.268
For cryin' out loud, what is Hel thinking?

02:15.268 --> 02:18.004
She can't seriously be thinking
of taking us on, right?

02:18.004 --> 02:20.006
And if she is, what will you do?

02:20.006 --> 02:21.774
The obvious, of course.

02:21.774 --> 02:23.401
You would fight her?

02:24.110 --> 02:26.738
What about you?

02:28.381 --> 02:30.781
I don't know. I really don't.

02:31.017 --> 02:33.349
Then let me answer that for you.

02:38.458 --> 02:39.792
It's been a while.

02:39.792 --> 02:40.894
Hel!

02:40.894 --> 02:42.295
Why are you here?!

02:42.295 --> 02:46.857
I've come all this way to see you,
and this is how you talk to me?

02:47.066 --> 02:50.365
Shut your mouth! Give us back
the mystery girl right now!

02:50.670 --> 02:51.864
No.

02:52.672 --> 02:56.476
Hel, why are you doing this?
What the heck do you want?

02:56.476 --> 02:58.912
What do I want? I'll tell you.

02:58.912 --> 03:01.779
I want my brothers to stay out of my way.

03:02.015 --> 03:03.482
That's why...

03:04.083 --> 03:05.880
Veil Lubadrock.

03:08.488 --> 03:10.115
Daddy!

03:20.733 --> 03:22.068
Yamino?

03:22.068 --> 03:23.169
Fenrir!

03:23.169 --> 03:24.363
Ecchan!

03:26.973 --> 03:27.940
Hel!

03:29.175 --> 03:30.977
Daddy! Save me!

03:30.977 --> 03:32.774
Master Loki!

03:34.647 --> 03:36.012
Everyone!

03:49.028 --> 03:51.130
Now there won't be anyone
to get in the way.

03:51.130 --> 03:53.098
That's not all.

03:54.901 --> 03:58.132
Now Father will know what it's like...

03:59.239 --> 04:03.801
when those who should be
there for you are gone.

04:43.149 --> 04:45.617
This doesn't taste any good, Yamino.

04:56.829 --> 04:58.626
How do you like being alone?

05:02.835 --> 05:03.802
Huh?

05:06.739 --> 05:09.409
Do you know someone who lives here?

05:09.409 --> 05:10.576
No.

05:10.576 --> 05:11.543
Huh?

05:12.045 --> 05:14.714
There's no one here anymore.

05:14.714 --> 05:16.682
They've all died.

05:24.123 --> 05:25.590
What do you mean?

05:47.213 --> 05:49.182
Where were you?

05:49.182 --> 05:50.479
Nowhere important.

05:50.850 --> 05:53.546
Well, no matter. Everything is ready.

06:08.968 --> 06:10.470
What is this?

06:10.470 --> 06:12.802
Enjoy your trip with Loki.

06:16.075 --> 06:18.270
There's no destination indicated.

06:18.811 --> 06:20.676
You decide that yourself.

06:22.782 --> 06:26.183
It will be what you will it to be.
Make it whatever you like.

06:28.488 --> 06:31.423
I have decided on a destination.

06:54.914 --> 06:56.381
A ticket?

08:10.089 --> 08:12.525
It's been a while, Father.

08:12.525 --> 08:14.652
I didn't think we'd be able to meet again.

08:14.894 --> 08:15.918
Yeah.

08:16.195 --> 08:19.432
I thought you would've forgotten about me.

08:19.432 --> 08:20.729
Not at all.

08:22.702 --> 08:24.567
I'm glad to hear it, even if it is a lie.

08:24.937 --> 08:26.131
Where's Mayura?

08:27.039 --> 08:28.666
Where are Yamino and Fenrir?

08:29.709 --> 08:33.145
You're very kind to be so concerned
about everyone.

08:35.781 --> 08:39.418
It's unsettling when the people who
are supposed to be there for you

08:39.418 --> 08:41.045
suddenly vanish, isn't it?

08:41.387 --> 08:46.058
Back in the other world, I thought about
you and the others all the time.

08:46.058 --> 08:48.356
I'd wonder what you were doing.

08:52.398 --> 08:56.630
And if the three of you were
getting along without me.

09:00.673 --> 09:05.144
But the more I thought about it,
the more uncomfortable I became.

09:05.144 --> 09:08.113
Eventually, I stopped thinking
about it altogether.

09:11.450 --> 09:14.419
Does that make me a bad person?

09:15.621 --> 09:18.089
Won't you answer that either?

09:18.591 --> 09:23.995
I guess not. After all, you seemed
happy enough without me around.

09:24.764 --> 09:26.061
Hel...

09:27.033 --> 09:32.403
He showed me how you were all doing
after coming to the world of humans.

09:33.573 --> 09:35.541
I couldn't believe it.

09:35.942 --> 09:38.344
How could you have been
having such a good time

09:38.344 --> 09:40.938
despite having been banished
from the world of the gods?

09:41.981 --> 09:45.178
It seems you've changed somewhat, Father.

09:58.998 --> 10:01.626
What is this girl, Mayura, to you?

10:11.944 --> 10:13.104
Mayura!

10:15.982 --> 10:18.382
Stop this, Hel!

10:27.793 --> 10:28.657
Mayura!

10:46.379 --> 10:50.782
This is the first time I've seen you
so shaken, Father.

11:28.087 --> 11:29.452
Is it good?

11:30.856 --> 11:34.815
I wonder if it does indeed taste better when you
drink with someone else rather than alone.

11:35.995 --> 11:38.463
Things are so dull when you're
alone, aren't they?

11:39.165 --> 11:45.126
When you went off with my brothers,
I was always alone.

11:45.604 --> 11:46.866
Hel...

11:47.673 --> 11:50.369
Father, do you like flowers?

11:53.179 --> 11:55.044
I don't like them.

11:57.216 --> 12:01.676
They're pretty, but they can't take
the place of someone to talk to.

12:02.154 --> 12:05.248
So why have them at all?

12:13.432 --> 12:16.869
The place I was in was very nice.

12:16.869 --> 12:20.339
See? There's nothing here, is there?

12:20.339 --> 12:23.137
Right from the start, it does
nothing for you, does it?

12:27.012 --> 12:29.879
I guess you wouldn't understand.

12:34.386 --> 12:37.878
After all, you never did care about me.

12:38.224 --> 12:39.122
Right?

12:44.697 --> 12:45.823
Mayura!

12:49.568 --> 12:53.906
Could this be the real one?
Or another illusion perhaps?

12:53.906 --> 12:55.373
Which do you think it is?

12:55.741 --> 12:56.901
Hel...

13:09.221 --> 13:10.347
Hel...

13:10.956 --> 13:12.253
Are you angry?

13:14.927 --> 13:16.495
No?

13:16.495 --> 13:17.962
Why not?

13:20.032 --> 13:22.835
You're always like this.

13:22.835 --> 13:25.201
You never say anything to me.

13:29.608 --> 13:33.738
You really don't care about me, do you?

13:37.950 --> 13:40.282
You hate me, don't you?

13:40.452 --> 13:41.510
Hel!

13:42.421 --> 13:48.553
I'm so thick-headed that I never
realized you felt that way.

13:49.495 --> 13:51.263
That's not true!

13:51.263 --> 13:53.561
There's no way I could ever hate you!

13:54.033 --> 13:55.330
Liar.

13:56.735 --> 13:58.703
Your father hates you?

14:01.307 --> 14:05.211
Yes. Though I love him very much...

14:05.211 --> 14:07.379
My father despises me.

14:07.379 --> 14:09.347
That can't be!

14:10.850 --> 14:13.219
Someone loves you, don't they?

14:13.219 --> 14:17.155
Your father tried desperately to
protect his daughter.

14:17.623 --> 14:20.456
There's no way that parents could
ever hate their children!

14:23.929 --> 14:27.387
You don't know what you're talking about!

14:37.476 --> 14:38.568
Liar.

14:42.748 --> 14:44.045
You...

14:46.385 --> 14:48.785
That's right. They're just a bunch of liars.

14:49.989 --> 14:54.949
When I heard that my father hates me,
I was filled with sadness.

14:56.629 --> 14:57.789
Odin!

14:58.297 --> 15:00.366
It would have been better if I'd never known.

15:00.366 --> 15:05.167
If I hadn't known, I'd still be able
to believe in my father.

15:05.404 --> 15:09.864
I would have been able to sleep soundly,
even in a cold, dark world.

15:10.342 --> 15:12.640
I would never have felt like I do now.

15:13.445 --> 15:14.571
Odin...

15:15.714 --> 15:19.150
I'll never forgive this. Odin!

15:24.790 --> 15:25.916
Hel...

15:26.558 --> 15:30.329
There are so many things I want
to talk with you about.

15:30.329 --> 15:31.819
Where should I start?

15:33.666 --> 15:35.566
I'm sorry, Hel.

15:36.602 --> 15:38.570
Why are you apologizing?

15:39.238 --> 15:42.867
I had no idea you had to endure such pain.

15:43.709 --> 15:47.577
If only I'd realized earlier how you feel...

15:49.114 --> 15:50.308
Father...

15:51.383 --> 15:52.680
I'm sorry.

15:54.653 --> 15:55.988
No!

15:55.988 --> 15:58.923
Those aren't the words I want to hear!

16:00.859 --> 16:03.293
It's cold, isn't it? It hurts, doesn't it?

16:04.863 --> 16:08.094
The world I was in was even colder.

16:09.101 --> 16:12.901
But it was colder still when I was at home.

16:13.305 --> 16:15.500
It was only my heart that was freezing.

16:16.675 --> 16:19.912
You had "no idea" how I felt?

16:19.912 --> 16:22.414
If only you had "realized sooner"?

16:22.414 --> 16:24.083
How dare you say such things?!

16:24.083 --> 16:26.085
Wait, Hel!

16:26.085 --> 16:27.848
I hate you so much!

16:32.024 --> 16:33.525
Why?

16:33.525 --> 16:35.823
Why wouldn't you love me?

16:40.733 --> 16:42.935
You know what? I love books.

16:42.935 --> 16:45.904
Because when I'm reading them,
I can forget about everything else.

16:51.043 --> 16:55.571
With books, I can be in places
and with people I like.

16:56.115 --> 16:57.446
I'm not lonely.

16:58.250 --> 16:59.274
Hel.

17:04.623 --> 17:07.922
But enough about that.
My dreaming is over.

17:26.678 --> 17:30.045
I've wanted to be with you.

17:31.316 --> 17:35.412
Come with me on a journey
for all eternity, Father.

17:51.970 --> 17:55.133
From now on, we'll be together, forever.

17:57.609 --> 17:59.736
That sounds nice, doesn't it, Father?

18:06.685 --> 18:08.312
Father...

18:42.588 --> 18:44.715
All right, Hel.

18:46.825 --> 18:49.020
We'll stay here together.

18:56.568 --> 18:58.536
Forever and ever.

19:02.674 --> 19:05.472
I thought you hated me.

19:08.580 --> 19:09.979
I'm so happy.

19:30.602 --> 19:32.504
This is a beautiful place, isn't it?

19:32.504 --> 19:33.630
Yes.

19:38.443 --> 19:42.080
While with an eye made quiet by the power

19:42.080 --> 19:44.249
Of harmony, and the deep power of joy,

19:44.249 --> 19:46.717
we see into the life of things.

19:48.987 --> 19:50.682
Wordsworth!

20:09.808 --> 20:10.832
Hel?

20:12.144 --> 20:14.313
It looks like I'm done for.

20:14.313 --> 20:17.583
And after I'd finally fulfilled my dream.

20:17.583 --> 20:19.881
It's kind of a shame.

20:23.055 --> 20:24.545
I'm sorry.

20:26.925 --> 20:29.894
Do you think, someday,
I could be your daughter?

20:32.064 --> 20:35.932
Of course. You will always,
always be my daughter, Hel.

20:36.969 --> 20:40.268
I'm so glad I was able to hear
those words in the end.

20:44.643 --> 20:48.602
It's such a relief that I'm starting
to feel kind of sleepy.

20:49.248 --> 20:52.649
It's all right. Have a nice, long sleep.

20:53.218 --> 20:56.085
Goodnight, Father.

21:29.554 --> 21:30.680
Hel...

21:58.283 --> 21:59.580
Hel...

22:16.968 --> 22:28.937
A moonlit road pierces the dense fog

22:30.649 --> 22:42.394
Perplexedly, we all wander towards tomorrow

22:42.394 --> 22:49.501
We escape the darkness of a desolate town

22:49.501 --> 22:55.941
Which threatens to halt even the telling of myths

22:55.941 --> 23:05.450
Transcending the limitless skies,
we're on a journey

23:05.450 --> 23:09.788
Even if we're hurt

23:09.788 --> 23:21.800
We're sure we can still make it,
so we want to keep on praying

23:21.800 --> 23:23.529
Believe in Heaven

23:31.343 --> 23:32.144
Next Episode

23:32.144 --> 23:33.745
Next Episode
Loki...

23:33.745 --> 23:38.884
Next Episode
I never thought about this,
about you going away.

23:38.884 --> 23:39.885
Next Episode

23:39.885 --> 23:41.186
Next Episode
Loki...

23:41.186 --> 23:42.854
Next Episode
Who are you?

23:42.854 --> 23:45.590
Next Episode
Where did you come from?
Where are you going?

23:45.590 --> 23:45.991
Next Episode

23:45.991 --> 23:49.795
Next Episode
You still haven't told me anything!

23:49.795 --> 23:49.861
Next Episode

23:49.861 --> 23:51.997
Next Episode
Come on, Loki!

23:51.997 --> 23:53.198
Next Episode

23:53.198 --> 23:55.634
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,
the final episode,

23:55.634 --> 23:56.334
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,
the final episode,

23:56.334 --> 23:56.535
The 26th Night
The Gods Depart
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,
the final episode,

23:56.535 --> 23:58.537
The 26th Night
The Gods Depart
"The Gods Depart"

23:58.537 --> 24:00.372
The 26th Night
The Gods Depart
Is this goodbye?

24:00.372 --> 24:01.134
The 26th Night
The Gods Depart
